Subject: [PATCH 134/161] hjviewer: review fixes, phonefiles lane (1.9)

U15 (major): the phone file transfer's 'Local / Remote' switch keeps
upstream's minWidth 100. In toggle_switch each segment's 10 px padding on
both sides is inside minWidth, so 88 left 45 px for the label and English
"Remote" in the AppBar's bold title style (about 51 px at 14 px) ended in
an ellipsis. 100 leaves 57 px; the FittedBox(scaleDown) still shrinks the
switch on phones narrower than its 203 px.

U15 (nit): the switch moves into _hjvSideSwitch() with one HjvPalette
lookup instead of eight.

U15 (nit): BottomSheetBody's IconTheme subtree re-indented as dart format
writes it. No behaviour change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
